{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>內地股市個別發展。</p><p></p><p>上證綜合指數和滬深300指數終止連日跌勢。深證成分指數和深圳創業板指數，則連跌第五日，跌幅不足百分之1。滬深京三市成交1.57萬億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>創新藥板塊受壓，低空經濟概念股則造好。</p><p></p><p>總計全星期，內地股市四大指數全線下跌，跌幅約百分之2至9，以深圳創業板指數跌幅最大。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T09:00:02.705608+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T08:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T11:17:53.162047+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T08:57:51.526520+00:00","content_hash":"14e8b67283af4332f866c3eb5470e2b300dcfa7249dbd4c39a7fc15ea2f329fd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}